{
  "code": "sound_velocity",
  "name": "声速测量实验",
  "enabled": true,
  "category": "acoustics",
  "description": "支持实验指导、手动数据记录、过程考核与报告；仪器自动采集待后续接入。",
  "dataCollection": {
    "enabled": true
  },
  "processScoreWeight": 40,
  "menuLabels": [
    "换能器与信号检查",
    "工作频率与稳定波形",
    "驻波极值位置记录",
    "声速与温度影响分析",
    "实验结束与资料整理"
  ],
  "steps": {
    "1": {
      "title": "换能器与信号检查",
      "guidePath": "steps/1.md",
      "correctionMode": "vision",
      "dataSource": "manual",
      "imageRequired": true,
      "assessmentRequired": true,
      "assessmentBlocking": false,
      "assessmentMaxScore": 20,
      "assessmentCriteria": [
        "使发射和接收换能器中心等高、轴线重合",
        "连接信号源与示波器，低幅度起调并记录环境温度",
        "原始记录、单位与过程证据清楚"
      ]
    },
    "2": {
      "title": "工作频率与稳定波形",
      "guidePath": "steps/2.md",
      "correctionMode": "data",
      "dataSource": "manual",
      "imageRequired": true,
      "assessmentRequired": true,
      "assessmentBlocking": false,
      "assessmentMaxScore": 20,
      "assessmentCriteria": [
        "在换能器允许频段寻找稳定接收信号",
        "记录实际工作频率和温度，保持后续测量频率不变",
        "原始记录、单位与过程证据清楚"
      ],
      "dataFields": [
        {
          "key": "frequency_kHz",
          "label": "工作频率",
          "type": "number",
          "required": true,
          "photoAssist": false,
          "unit": "kHz",
          "min": 1e-06
        },
        {
          "key": "temperature_C",
          "label": "环境温度",
          "type": "number",
          "required": true,
          "photoAssist": false,
          "unit": "°C"
        }
      ]
    },
    "3": {
      "title": "驻波极值位置记录",
      "guidePath": "steps/3.md",
      "correctionMode": "data",
      "dataSource": "manual",
      "imageRequired": true,
      "assessmentRequired": true,
      "assessmentBlocking": false,
      "assessmentMaxScore": 20,
      "assessmentCriteria": [
        "沿同一方向逐个寻找同类幅度极值并记录位置",
        "跨多个间隔测量，使用表格保存所有位置以便逐差处理",
        "原始记录、单位与过程证据清楚"
      ],
      "dataFields": [
        {
          "key": "start_position_mm",
          "label": "起始极值位置",
          "type": "number",
          "required": true,
          "photoAssist": false,
          "unit": "mm"
        },
        {
          "key": "end_position_mm",
          "label": "末端极值位置",
          "type": "number",
          "required": true,
          "photoAssist": false,
          "unit": "mm"
        },
        {
          "key": "interval_count",
          "label": "同类极值间隔数 N",
          "type": "number",
          "required": true,
          "photoAssist": false,
          "min": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    "4": {
      "title": "声速与温度影响分析",
      "guidePath": "steps/4.md",
      "correctionMode": "data",
      "dataSource": "manual",
      "imageRequired": true,
      "assessmentRequired": true,
      "assessmentBlocking": false,
      "assessmentMaxScore": 20,
      "assessmentCriteria": [
        "按 λ=2",
        "Δx",
        "/N 求波长，再由 v=fλ 求声速",
        "记录重复结果并分析温度、对准、近场及极值定位的影响",
        "原始记录、单位与过程证据清楚"
      ],
      "dataFields": [
        {
          "key": "wavelength_mm",
          "label": "波长",
          "type": "number",
          "required": true,
          "photoAssist": false,
          "unit": "mm",
          "min": 1e-06
        },
        {
          "key": "velocity_m_s",
          "label": "声速",
          "type": "number",
          "required": true,
          "photoAssist": false,
          "unit": "m/s",
          "min": 1e-06
        }
      ]
    },
    "5": {
      "title": "实验结束与资料整理",
      "guidePath": "steps/5.md",
      "correctionMode": "vision",
      "dataSource": "manual",
      "imageRequired": true,
      "assessmentRequired": true,
      "assessmentBlocking": false,
      "assessmentMaxScore": 20,
      "assessmentCriteria": [
        "按现场规程停机或关闭光源、电源，将调节机构恢复安全位置",
        "整理原始记录、数据表格和过程照片，检查报告所需信息并清理台面",
        "原始记录、单位与过程证据清楚"
      ]
    }
  },
  "reportGuidePath": "report-guide.md"
}
